# Boundary config for 5-stage alternating analog/digital inverter chain
# Stages 1,3,5: analog (Xyce cmos_inv)
# Stages 2,4: digital (NVC digital_inv)
#
# D2A: read NVC testbench signal voltage -> Xyce PWL source
# A2D: Xyce node voltage -> deposit into NVC signal

# Stage 1: stim -> analog inv -> s1
D2A .stim in1
A2D .s1 out1

# Stage 3: s2 (digital) -> analog inv -> s3
D2A .s2 in3
A2D .s3 out3

# Stage 5: s4 (digital) -> analog inv -> chain_out
D2A .s4 in5
A2D .chain_out out5
